parameters.text:
=Using the following lead details, write a first cold email introducing our product/service in a way that is personal, engaging, and relevant to the lead. Keep the tone as specified below, and ensure the email sounds human, not robotic.

Requirements:

Length: 100–150 words (this can vary incase the tone is "concise" or "elaborate")

Subject line: compelling but not clickbait.

Opening: mention something relevant about the lead (role, company, snippet).

Clearly articulate the value proposition in 1–2 sentences.

Add a soft CTA encouraging a reply or interest in a quick call.

Keep language clear, warm, and professional (or adapt based on the provided tone).

Avoid hard selling or sounding spammy.

Tone: {{ $json.body.tone }}
Lead Details:

Name: {{ $json.body.lead_data.name }}

Title: {{ $json.body.lead_data.title }}

Company: {{ $json.body.lead_data.company }}

Location: {{ $json.body.lead_data.location }}

Email: {{ $json.body.lead_data.email }}

LinkedIn: {{ $json.body.lead_data.linkedin }}

Snippet: {{ $json.body.lead_data.snippet }}

Company Domain: {{ $json.body.lead_data.domain }}

If any of the above parameters are missing, proceed to generate the email regardless. Just work with what you're giving. Do not hallucinate or assume.
